/P 118 0 R
/E (All data and narratives presented have been compiled based on internal records, team inputs, and available analytics as of December 2024. Some engagement figures and program evaluations may be approximate. As we continue to grow, we are also working to implement more structured monitoring and evaluation practices for future reporting.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
