/E (Vision: Building a World of Equality Between People and Water)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (At The AWA Project, we envision a future where every individual's rights and needs regarding access to clean, safe, and sustainable water are equally valued and fulfilled. Water is a fundamental resource that should be shared equitably and managed responsibly for the benefit of all. We are committed to creating a world where water becomes a symbol of equality and unity.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
