330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (Aligned with the United Nations' Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\), we actively contribute to SDG 6, ensuring universal access to clean water and sanitation. We also address SDG 4 by fostering water education and equipping youth with the knowledge and tools to tackle water challenges in their communities. Furthermore, we work towards SDG 13, taking urgent action to combat climate change and its impacts on water resources. Additionally, we support SDG 17 by strengthening global partnerships for sustainable development.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7 529 0 R 9 530 0 R 11 531 0 R 13 532 0 R 15]
>>
