/P 125 0 R
/E (Our approach is grounded in three core pillars that guide our work and shape how we measure impact. While we have organized our work under these three distinct pillars, we recognize that each initiative we undertake often spans across all of them. Advocacy, community action, and access to information are deeply interconnected. It is at their intersection that our impact is most powerful. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
