353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (We believe lasting change requires that all voices are heard, valued, and empowered. For us, water justice is inseparable from social justice, which is why we create inclusive spaces where diverse perspectives shape our programs and decisions.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
