/E (March 2024: Andrea Caceres, Founder and Executive Director, was a keynote speaker at the International Women's Day event organized by the Alberta Council for Global Cooperation and the Center for Global Education. She shared her experiences leading The AWA Project, focusing on empowering marginalized communities and advancing water and human rights. Through her leadership, Andrea has championed youth inclusion, gender equity, and sustainability, inspiring students across Canada and beyond to engage in global water advocacy.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
