/E (November 2024: Public Affairs Director, Mafer Chaparro, represented The AWA Project at APEC's Youth Forum in Peru. The event brought together 30 young changemakers focused on addressing global challenges. The forum emphasized the importance of horizontal networking, where young leaders share knowledge and resources for collaborative change. AWA remains committed to empowering youth and ensuring equitable access to clean water globally.)
