/P 133 0 R
/E (This project, in collaboration with FONDEMAR, aims to increase youth participation in water management decisions in Marcona, Ica, a region facing water scarcity and distribution issues. It involves gathering youth perspectives on water sustainability, raising awareness, and empowering young people to propose solutions. Through surveys, workshops, and policy proposal development, the project seeks to build youth capacity to influence local water governance. We are currently in the desinging phase and applying for funding. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
